---
title: Baked French Toast
source: Matt
servings: 6
prep time: 3 hours 15 minutes
cook time: 45 minutes
---

Grease a #13x9 baking dish{} with @butter{1/2%stick}.

Spread @pie filling{1%can}(your choice of flavor) on the bottom of the dish.

Sprinkle @cinnamon{1%tsp}, @nuts{}(optional), and @brown sugar{1%cup} over the pie filling.

Lay slices of @Italian bread{1%loaf}(sliced) in the dish.

Whisk together @eggs{6}, @milk{1-1/2%cups}, and @vanilla{1%tsp} in a #bowl{}, then pour the mixture over the bread.

Refrigerate for at least ~{2%hours}.

Bake in the oven at 375 F for about ~{45%minutes}.
